WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.200
-[music fades]
-[Laura] What are you doing here?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.200
What does it look like I'm doing? [scoffs]

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.200
[sighs] I'm winning.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.640
Massimo made a huge mistake

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.840
by underestimating the anger
of the abandoned woman.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.160
[laughing]

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.520
[suspenseful music continues playing]

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.040
What are you doing here?

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.440
You were supposed to wait in Sicily
until the negotiations were over.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.160
You know them?

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:41.680
Honey, we were the ones
who pushed you into his arms.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.320
[Adriano breathing shakily]

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.160
[in Italian] Did you really think
you could just say the word

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.440
and I'd disappear from your life?

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.800
That I would've lived
off your handouts in exile?

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.240
No, Massimo. No.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.280
[breathing shakily]

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.800
You finally showed your weakness.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.800
Question is,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.360
do you really think this little whore's
worth the whole empire our father created?

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.440
[clicks tongue wildly, snorts]

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.760
Though I have to say,
she's not bad. [kisses]

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:26.600
[kisses]

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.520
[kisses, sucks teeth]

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:38.920
[in English] Sometimes I wonder

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.280
if your child

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.000
would've looked more like you…

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.640
[smacks lips] …or like her.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:49.360
-♪ I tried to forget your name… ♪
-Huh?

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.640
It's a pity.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.840
It's a pity that we will never know.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.520
Because of the accident.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.560
♪ To myself ♪

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.880
-♪ Are we damned? ♪
-[sounds echoing]

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.000
[shot echoes]

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:08.480
♪ We almost lost this game… ♪

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.320
[shot echoes]

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.240
♪ This is the end ♪

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.120
[music swells]

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:25.960
[shot echoes]

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:30.160
[music fades]

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.240
["Another Day" playing]

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:45.120
♪ There was a time when I felt inside ♪

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:53.520
♪ Love and hate, but you were mine ♪

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:02.360
♪ You were the only reason to make ♪

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:07.360
♪ My eyes smile over and over again ♪

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.800
♪ And I just feel this fear ♪

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:14.480
♪ Is eating me inside now ♪

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:21.920
♪ If you believed in my eyes ♪

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.480
♪ We would've had another day ♪

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:31.360
♪ And you just see me inside ♪

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.440
♪ I swear we would have another day ♪

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:39.000
♪ Another day ♪

